          "guid": "mt2kpu7ek9aojsdg",
          "message": {
            "text": "Selected-font provenance now binds logical glyph records to exact source bytes and the live platform descriptor axis dictionary. A focused macOS run recorded PingFangUI.tcc SHA-256 13b201d6…, WDTH=500/wght=400/HGHT=500, source gid 40500/advance 1009, while the same artifact's browser cell records PingFangSC-Regular and Range width 32.296875px.",
            "markdown": "Selected-font provenance now binds logical glyph records to exact source bytes and the live platform descriptor axis dictionary. A focused macOS run recorded PingFangUI.tcc SHA-256 13b201d6…, WDTH=500/wght=400/HGHT=500, source gid 40500/advance 1009, while the same artifact's browser cell records PingFangSC-Regular and Range width 32.296875px."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/text-run-provenance.ts"
